    "title": "New Restaurants in Metro Detroit to Try this March 2026 - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By SEEN Staff ,\n13 hours ago The metro Detroit dining scene is ever expanding. From James Beard nominees and Michelin-starred chefs to mom-and-pop diners, fast-casual concepts and pop-ups turned brick-and-mortar, there are new restaurants and flavors to explore throughout the region. With its rich variety of cultures and culinary influences from near and far, we can’t wait to try all of these spots — and share our recommendations for the ones we’ve already visited. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
